@sessionId = 1
@student17 = 17
@student19 = 19
@tutor47 = 47
@tutor48 = 48

### ========================================
### SESSIONS
### Regla fuerte:
### - Tutor solo accede a sesiones de sus estudiantes
### - Student solo accede a sus propias sesiones
### ========================================

### [OK] Tutor 47 lista sesiones de su tutorId
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor47}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Tutor 47 no puede listar sesiones de tutor 48
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor48}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Tutor 47 lista sesiones del student 17 (asignado)
GET {{host}}/students/{{student17}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Tutor 47 no puede listar sesiones del student 19 (tutor 48)
GET {{host}}/students/{{student19}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Student 17 lista sus sesiones
GET {{host}}/students/{{student17}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{student17Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Student 17 no puede listar sesiones de student 19
GET {{host}}/students/{{student19}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{student17Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Obtener sesión por id (si pertenece al tutor)
GET {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### POST /sessions
POST {{host}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idStudent": {{student17}},
  "beginningDate": "2026-05-10T09:00:00",
  "endDate": null,
  "device": "Laptop"
}

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] POST /sessions para estudiante de otro tutor
POST {{host}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idStudent": {{student19}},
  "beginningDate": "2026-05-11T14:00:00",
  "endDate": null,
  "device": "Tablet"
}

### PUT /sessions/{id} dentro de su alcance
PUT {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idStudent": {{student17}},
  "beginningDate": "2026-05-10T09:30:00",
  "endDate": null,
  "device": "Desktop"
}

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] PUT intenta mover sesión a estudiante de otro tutor
PUT {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idStudent": {{student19}},
  "beginningDate": "2026-05-10T09:30:00",
  "endDate": null,
  "device": "Desktop"
}

### DELETE /sessions/{id}
DELETE {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json
